# The staging front end's API — ClassAura (LBC).
#
# Only read by `npm run build:staging` (vite build --mode staging). A plain
# `npm run build` is production mode and reads .env.production, which is gitignored
# and therefore NOT in this repository — set VITE_API_URL in Vercel instead.
#
# DELIBERATELY NOT SET. This file used to carry EdTech's staging API, inherited when
# this repository was forked from it. Pointing a ClassAura build at EdTech's API would
# send one college's staff at another college's live data, so the value is blank until
# ClassAura's own staging API exists. A staging build made before then fails visibly
# (api.js falls back to the current hostname), which is the correct way to find out.
#
# Fill in once the service is created, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_URL="https://classaura-staging-api.onrender.com/api"
VITE_API_URL=""
